.TH TESSA-PANEL 1 "2026-10-29" "Tessa 0.2.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tessa-panel \- Tessa taskbar, launcher, and desktop widgets
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tessa-panel
.RB [ \-\-check | \-\-print\-config ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tessa-panel
is normally started by
.BR tessa (1)
once per output. It draws the taskbar and wallpaper, runs the launcher and
popovers, and provides the notification service and StatusNotifier tray host.
.PP
The panel reads the same configuration file and re-reads it after a compositor
config-reload event.
.PP
With
.B \-\-check
or
.BR \-\-print\-config ,
the panel loads the configuration, prints the resolved per-surface fonts,
colors, bar module order/fonts, and wallpaper source, then exits without
connecting to Wayland.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TESSA_PANEL_OUTPUT
Output name this panel instance is attached to.
.TP
.B TESSA_PANEL_DEBUG
Set to any value for additional panel logging.
.TP
.B TESSA_PANEL_BIN
Binary path used by the compositor when starting a panel.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tessa (1),
.BR tessa-ctl (1)
